How many members are in $S \cap T'$, and how many are in $S \cup T$?

mastery.solution_text:
$S \cap T'$ is the region that has not been filled in, so subtract the other three regions from the total.
$60 - 14 - 11 - 9$
$= 26$
$S \cup T$ is the three regions inside the circles.
$26 + 14 + 11$
$= 51$
